  "origin.originsevolved.feline_evolved.name": "Feline Evolved",
  "origin.originsevolved.feline_evolved.description": "Now that you've killed that big bird, you take a bite of his flesh. The moment you taste the pure magic in the Ender Dragons flesh you feel the your inner beast awakening making you evolve.",

  "power.originsevolved.freehand_ev.name": "Tiger Claws",
  "power.originsevolved.freehand_ev.description": "After evolving your claws got sharper and tougher, you're now able to do a significant amount of damage with just your fists,",

  "power.originsevolved.faster_attacks_ev.name": "Fast Attacks",
  "power.originsevolved.faster_attacks_ev.description": "The magic from the Ender Dragon flesh makes you attack faster with only your claws.",

  "power.originsevolved.pounce_ev.name": "Dragon's Rage",
  "power.originsevolved.pounce_ev.description": "The magic from the Ender Dragon's flesh also gives you a taste of his hate, his rage. This makes you bloodthirsty, giving you bloodlust, with 4 stacks of bloodlust you become faster, gives you increased range and your next attack makes you jump towards your enemy doing more damage than usual. After that the blood you got heals you and your bloodlust will fade.",

  "power.originsevolved.natural_enemy_ev.name": "Natural Enemy",
  "power.originsevolved.natural_enemy_ev.description": "Wolves don't really like you.",


  // Merling

  // Merling Evolved
  "origin.originsevolved.merling_evolved.name": "Merling Evolved",
  "origin.originsevolved.merling_evolved.description": "End magic rushed through your blood and stroke down into the locked pool of water magic deep inside you, you now feel the seal break a little and are able to use a little of the water magic your ancestors once used.",

  "power.originsevolved.reinforced_scale_ev.name": "Tougher Scales",
  "power.originsevolved.reinforced_scale_ev.description": "Not only your teeth got tougher, your scales also got a small upgrade. ",

  "power.originsevolved.neptune_blessing_ev.name": "Reversal Water",
  "power.originsevolved.neptune_blessing_ev.description": "Like before your system works quite different than the other, you're almost litterly reversed. Now that you've gained more experience from the outside world, you used the dragons magic to make the enchantments reverse, or give you buffs. If you use the Water Breathing enchantment you will gain dolphins grace. If you use an turtle helmet you will gain water breathing when above water.",

  "power.originsevolved.rain_summoning_ev.name": "Rain summoning",
  "power.originsevolved.rain_summoning_ev.description": "The dragons magic has awakened the elemental power inside you, you're now able to summon water in the form of rain.",

  "power.originsevolved.hot_places_ev.name": "Hot Places",
  "power.originsevolved.hot_places_ev.description": "There's no rain in places like the desert or the badlands, it's way to dry around there, because of this you're not able to use your rain summoning power.",

  "power.originsevolved.trident_ev.name": "The first trident",
  "power.originsevolved.trident_ev.description": "Long ago the water elementals used the trident as their weapon which was the best choice according to their power. Now whenever you hit someone a trident in the form of water will fall down from the sky",

