  "origin.originsevolved.shulk_evolved.description": "As the warden of the end city and creature of the end, after killing the monster in your dimension you gain a little from his end magic which makes you evolve into a stronger version of yourself.",

  "power.originsevolved.harder_shell_ev.name": "Natural Armor+",
