  "power.originsevolved.juggernaut_toggle_ev.name": "The Juggernaut",
  "power.originsevolved.juggernaut_toggle_ev.description": "Now that your armor is stabilized you're able to use it more efficiently, you can now retreat into your armor and use it as the ultimate defense. Your armor will protect you from much damage at the cost of your vision and your movement.",

